.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-PATH-DRAFT 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-path\-draft \- Draft a golden\-path policy from a trajectory as Turtle for review
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu path draft\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-name\fR] [\fB\-\-label\fR] [\fB\-\-via\fR] [\fB\-\-omit\fR] [\fB\-\-by\fR] [\fB\-\-dead\-end\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fItrajectory\-IRI\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Draft a golden\-path policy from a trajectory as Turtle for review
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-name\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Name of the generated object
.TP
\fB\-\-label\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Human\-readable label for the draft
.TP
\fB\-\-via\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Predicate or path used for traversal
.TP
\fB\-\-omit\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Trajectory step to omit in a counterfactual
.TP
\fB\-\-by\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Identity recording a resolution
.TP
\fB\-\-dead\-end\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Dead\-end trajectory to include in the policy draft
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print machine\-readable JSON
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fItrajectory\-IRI\fR>

